             '**WHAT IS IN THE FILES.** **Price lists, credit policy, the customer ledger, the claims book. One day of reading. I will not explain any of it.**',
             '**THREE CUSTOMERS WHO ARE NOT WHAT THEY LOOK LIKE.** **The Aleppo wholesaler shouts and pays on the day; the Homs one is courteous and is sixty days late every autumn.** **The coast agent is a broker and the real customer is a hotel group.**',
