             '**I am applying for the post of commercial manager, advertised on 28 May.** **I will not spend a paragraph on my interest in the firm.**',
             '**WHAT I HAVE DONE, WITH THE BASIS.** **Service level rose from 90.2 to 96.1 per cent over eleven months, measured by line and not by case, which is the harsher of the two measures and the one I chose to be judged on.** **Credit notes fell from about nine a week to three.** **And I found a stock-cover trend nobody had seen, because each weekly step was two tenths of a week.**',
